# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto
# Preserved 1999 releases: byte-for-byte as Mr Elusive distributed them.
# `* text=auto` above would otherwise be free to normalise anything it
# misdetects as text, which would silently invalidate SHA256SUMS.txt.
# Later patterns win, so the two text files are re-exempted below.
archive/** binary
archive/README.md text diff
archive/SHA256SUMS.txt text diff
